<title>USA: Norwest names strategy executive.</title>
<headline>Norwest names strategy executive.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norwest Corp said Tuesday it named Anat Bird, a financial services consultant, to the newly created position of senior vice president of strategic initiatives.</p>
<p>Bird is chief executive of SCB Forums, a New York-based consulting firm. She will report to Les Biller, Norwest's president and chief operating officer, and help direct the company's strategic initiatives, Norwest said.</p>
<p>-- Reuter Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
